# OpenWeatherMap API Configuration
# Get your free API key from: https://openweathermap.org/api
VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=fcf7e5322bde0ae0d3f5d51eb2afcb3c

# Google Maps API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# Enable Maps JavaScript API and 3D Tiles API
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSyA-EJH5xFjEvEsRo7swVfBzvDgQnXg1ao8

# Instructions:
# 1. Sign up at https://openweathermap.org/api
# 2. Get your free API key
# 3. Copy this file to .env
# 4. Replace 'your_api_key_here' with your actual API key
# 5. Get Google Maps API key from Google Cloud Console
# 6. Enable Maps JavaScript API and 3D Tiles API
# 7. Add your Google Maps API key to VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY